      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pediatric chest pain is not an uncommon presenting complaint in the emergency department. Although the majority of cases are benign, the authors report on a patient with a fetal case of myocarditis. A discussion of myocarditis and its management as well as differential diagnosis is included."},
